# Every pattern starts with "/", so it applies to art/blender/ itself and to nothing below it:
# art/blender/hand/** (the hand rig, its .blend files and renders) is never ignored by this file.
# Your own working file here (for example hand_poses.blend) is not ignored either: commit it.
